# ==============================================================================
# E-Wakku Environment Configuration Template
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY GUIDANCE:
# 1. Copy this template to .env.local for local development: `cp .env.example .env.local`.
# 2. NEVER commit .env.local, API secrets, or service keys to version control.
# 3. Next.js automatically exposes variables prefixed with `NEXT_PUBLIC_` to browser
#    bundles. Variables WITHOUT the `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix remain strictly server-side.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser-Exposed Supabase Configuration (Client & Server)
# Safe for browser exposure: public URL and anonymous/public API key subject to RLS.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-Only Privileged Service Role Key (Server Actions & Route Handlers ONLY)
#
# CRITICAL SECURITY REQUIREMENTS:
# - NEVER prefix this variable with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Prefixing it will bundle the key
#   into client-side JavaScript, completely bypassing all PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS).
# - Required for administrative provisioning, user creation, metadata persistence verification,
#   and fallback administrative removal in app/admin/profile/actions.ts.
# - Failure behavior: If this key is missing, the application fails closed (disables
#   admin account creation and removal with an explicit server configuration error).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-supabase-service-role-key

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Production Site URL (Public)
# Used for canonical URL generation, SEO, OpenGraph metadata, and auth callback validation.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://e-wakku.vercel.app/
